## 🔌 Integration with AI Agents (Qwen / Hermes)

ALCHEMI endpoints can be called directly from AI coding agents for autonomous materials discovery:

### Continue.dev / VS Code Configuration

Add to `~/.continue/config.yaml`:

```yaml
